  "conclusion": "diagnostic gain over parent with material locality sensitivity; below parent geomean target in both orders and slower than CRDB in every cell; no promotion or full-goal completion",
  "notes": [
    "Short diagnostic: one table, 1024 rows, two repetitions, C1/C8, one ordinary SQL entrypoint, one Docker host; three fused nodes / three CRDB nodes versus nine parent role processes plus standalone gateway.",
    "Throughput and p99 entries are medians of the two trial summaries within each order. Geomeans give equal weight to all ten workload/concurrency cells. Order results are not pooled.",
    "The first candidate fixture used remote gateway calls for reads and updates; the second used local calls. This observed locality difference correlates with the read-rate change and prevents treating the order difference as purely temporal noise. No leader-aware routing was configured.",
    "Update append-barrier counts are cluster totals across three nodes, not six barriers on each node and not directly measured fsync latency. Brackets include background work.",
    "Zero update gateway_semantic_sql_calls and SQL request encodings describe the semantic SQL path only. Legacy command calls remain, including local native semantic transport dispatches in the second fixture; zero SQL encodes does not prove zero serialization.",
    "All checkpoint submission, wait and service counters were zero across candidate trial brackets. This run does not measure checkpoint overhead or prove performance under checkpoints.",
    "There were zero SQL/sample errors and all trials verified. Native transport failed counters increased by five in the first candidate fixture and six in the second, during C1 updates; these are connection-service failure counters, not SQL failure counts, and their cause was not established by this audit. Ready-wave failures, native rejections, remote poison/rejection/handshake-failure counters and checkpoint rejections stayed zero during trial brackets.",
    "Inventory parsing recorded warnings for non-JSON VibeDB manifest.binding and CockroachDB MANIFEST/marker files. These are separate from SQL operation failures; counts are retained in source records.",
    "The 1.25x parent geomean target was not met in either ordering. No per-order cell crossed the 5% throughput or 10% p99 regression guardrails, but this shortened run cannot qualify the registered 8192-row/three-repetition matrix, multigroup benefit, full correctness gates or full 2x CockroachDB objective."
  ],
